{"id":"R001","class":"continuity","status":"validated","description":"Current GSD artifacts must be the active source of truth for future planning and execution in this repo.","source":".gsd/PROJECT.md; .gsd/milestones/M001/M001-CONTEXT.md; .gsd/milestones/M001/slices/S01/S01-SUMMARY.md","primary_owner":"M001/S01","validation":"Validated by S01: `.gsd/PROJECT.md` exists, names `.gsd/` as the active source of truth, keeps `.planning/` as archive/reference evidence, reflects current package layout and shipped trajectory, and avoids legacy conversion overclaims.","notes":"Active truth belongs in `.gsd/`; `.planning/` remains historical evidence only."}
{"id":"R002","class":"continuity","status":"validated","description":"Selected legacy `.planning` high notes must be preserved in current GSD context without copying the archive wholesale.","source":".gsd/PROJECT.md; .gsd/milestones/M001/M001-CONTEXT.md; .planning/PROJECT.md; .planning/MILESTONES.md; .gsd/milestones/M001/slices/S02/S02-SUMMARY.md","primary_owner":"M001/S02","validation":"Validated by S02 verifier: `.gsd/milestones/M001/M001-CONTEXT.md` preserves selected v1.1 through v1.11 high notes with source-path references and explicit selective/non-wholesale boundary language.","notes":"Preservation is selective and contextual; it is not a wholesale `.planning` conversion."}
{"id":"R003","class":"failure-visibility","status":"validated","description":"Deferred work and caveats from the legacy archive must be explicitly labeled so future agents do not mistake them for completed or active commitments.","source":".gsd/milestones/M001/M001-CONTEXT.md; .planning/CONTINUE-sweep-harness-fixes-3.md; .planning/deferred-items.md; .gsd/milestones/M001/slices/S02/S02-SUMMARY.md","primary_owner":"M001/S02","validation":"Validated by S02 verifier: deferred sweep handoff, stale snapshot caveat, process-debt notes, and archive/reference boundary are labeled in `.gsd/milestones/M001/M001-CONTEXT.md` without treating them as active or completed M001 commitments.","notes":"Includes cost-frontier rerun/winner-selection handoff and stale snapshot/process-debt caveats as future context only."}
{"id":"R004","class":"quality-attribute","status":"active","description":"Initialized GSD artifacts must be internally consistent, traceable to sampled legacy sources, and honest about omissions.","source":".gsd/PROJECT.md; .gsd/milestones/M001/M001-CONTEXT.md; .gsd/milestones/M001/M001-ROADMAP.md; .planning/CONTINUE-sweep-harness-fixes-3.md; .planning/deferred-items.md; .planning/PROJECT.md; .planning/MILESTONES.md","primary_owner":"M001/S03","validation":"Mapped for S03 verification: REQUIREMENTS must separate active, deferred, and out-of-scope records; active records must have M001 slice ownership; source references and prohibited-overclaim checks remain to be verified by the S03 requirements verifier.","notes":"Do not mark validated until S03 executable requirements verification passes."}
{"id":"R005","class":"launchability","status":"active","description":"M001 must produce an execution-ready roadmap for completing GSD initialization as demoable planning and curation slices.","source":".gsd/milestones/M001/M001-ROADMAP.md; .gsd/milestones/M001/M001-CONTEXT.md","primary_owner":"M001/S04","validation":"Mapped for S04 final readiness verification; not yet validated in T01.","notes":"Roadmap work is artifact-focused and does not imply product runtime code changes in M001."}
